<title>USA: CUC International names McLeod unit CEO.</title>
<headline>CUC International names McLeod unit CEO.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>CUC International Inc said on Tuesday it had named Christopher McLeod as chief executive officer of its computer software division, CUC Software.</p>
<p>McLeod, who was executive vice president at CUC International, will replace Robert Davidson, who resigned to pursue other interests, it said.</p>
<p>The company said McLeod will also oversee another unit called Davidson &amp; Associates, whose president, Janice Davidson also resigned.</p>
</text>
